## Model card

- **Name:** Mistral Large 3
- **Short description:** Mistral Large 3 is an Apache-2.0 open-weights MoE flagship (675B total / 41B active, 256K context, text+image input) released 2025-12-02 and later superseded by Mistral Large 4.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights (Apache 2.0) and hosted providers (e.g. Mistral La Plateforme). Local metadata lists `opencode/mistral-large-3`, pricing $0.50/$1.50 per 1M, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Artificial Analysis model page and local metadata reviewed 2026-11-10. AA marks the model deprecated/superseded. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in accessible reviewed content.
- **IDs:** `mistral-large-3`, `mistral-large-3-2512`, `opencode/mistral-large-3`.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.50/$1.50 per 1M in/out hosted (AA/metadata); self-host $0 under Apache 2.0.
- **Architecture:** Sparse MoE, 675B total / 41B active parameters, native vision support (AA/metadata).

